d “AS IS” and “AS AVAILABLE”, solely for informational, educational, and technical tool </strong><strong>purposes;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Do not constitute investment advice, trading advice, legal advice, tax advice, or recommendations of any </strong><strong>kind;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Shall not be relied upon as the basis for any investment or trading decision.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Past performance, simulated results, </strong><strong>backtests</strong><strong>, or hypothetical examples are not indicative of future results and may differ materially from actual trading outcomes.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>You acknowledge that all trading decisions are made solely at your own discretion and risk.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<p><strong>III. Automated Execution and </strong><strong>No Account</strong><strong> Control</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant does not access, log into, monitor, manage, or control your trading accounts.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>If you enable automated execution, you expressly acknowledge and agree that:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>All trade instructions are automatically generated by software based solely on the strategy parameters you </strong><strong>select;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>All orders are transmitted to and executed by third-party trading platforms that you independently </strong><strong>authorize;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant does not hold, custody, control, transfer, withdraw, or safeguard your funds or </strong><strong>assets;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant has no ability to override, modify, cancel, or manually intervene in your trades.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Automated execution is a technical facilitation tool only and does not reduce, transfer, or mitigate your trading risk.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>IV. High-Risk Trading Acknowledgment</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>You acknowledge and agree that trading digital assets, leveraged instruments, and derivatives involves extreme financial risk, including but not limited to:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Severe and unpredictable market </strong><strong>volatility;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Illiquidity or sudden changes in market </strong><strong>depth;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Leverage amplification, forced liquidation, margin calls, and total loss of </strong><strong>capital;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Strategy malfunction, logical failure, parameter mismatch, or </strong><strong>degradation;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Slippage, partial fills, failed executions, or execution at unfavorable </strong><strong>prices;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Network latency, system delays, API failures, duplicate orders, or missed stop-loss/take-profit events.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Such risks may result in the loss of some or </strong><strong>all of</strong><strong> your funds, and you acknowledge that you are fully responsible for assessing and accepting these risks.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>V. Third-Party and Technical Disclaimer</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>The Platform relies on third-party services, including but not limited to exchanges, brokers, APIs, cloud infrastructure, and data providers.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant makes no representations, warranties, or guarantees, express or implied, regarding:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Availability, reliability, accuracy, timeliness, or continuity of third-party </strong><strong>services;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Accuracy or completeness of any data or execution results.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant shall not be responsible for losses arising from third-party failures, technical malfunctions, force majeure events, or circumstances beyond its reasonable control.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<p><strong>VI. Limitation of Liability and Waiver of Claims</strong></p>\n<p><strong>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, you agree that:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive </strong><strong>damages;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Including, without limitation, loss of capital, loss of profits, trading losses, opportunity costs, business interruption, or data </strong><strong>loss;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>You irrevocably waive any claims against Vertex Quant arising from your use of the Platform or reliance on any information provided.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Your sole and exclusive remedy for dissatisfaction with the Platform is to discontinue its use.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<p><strong>VII. User Representations and Legal Compliance</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>You represent and warrant that:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>You have full legal capacity to </strong><strong>enter into</strong><strong> this </strong><strong>Disclaimer;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Your use of the Platform complies with all applicable laws, regulations, and regulatory requirements in your </strong><strong>jurisdiction;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>You are solely responsible for determining whether your use of the Platform is lawful.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant assumes no responsibility for any regulatory, legal, or financial consequences arising from your actions.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>VIII. Amendments</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Vertex Quant reserves the right to modify this Disclaimer at any time.</strong><strong>\nAny modifications become effective immediately upon publication.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Your continued use of the Platform constitutes acceptance of the revised Disclaimer.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>IX. Final and Binding Acknowledgment</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>You expressly acknowledge and agree that:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>All trading decisions are yours alone, and all trading risks and losses are borne solely by you.</strong><strong>\nAutomated execution does not eliminate risk.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"h-4\">